[I] The Bidirectional Algorithm library

[T] The library implements all of the algorithm as described in the "Unicode
[T] Standard Annex #9, The Bidirectional Algorithm,
[T] http://www.unicode.org/unicode/reports/tr9/". FriBidi is exhautively
[T] tested against Bidi Reference Code, and due to our best knowledge, does
[T] not contain any conformance bugs.

[U] https://github.com/fribidi/fribidi

